Origin:

Separate GPIO UART console support from temporary CM5 boot tracing.
CM5_BOOT_TRACE defaults to FALSE: normal GPIO console builds do not
interpose LoadImage/StartImage, record NV variables, wrap GPIO MMIO
or print ISR and SDHCI traces. Explicitly initialize RP1 serial after
publishing its bus protocol so console operation needs no trace writes.

